OL,3,CMan shot dead in south London
OL,5,FA murder investigation has been
OL,6,Flaunched after a 25-year-old man was
OL,7,Fshot dead in south London, the
OL,8,FMetropolitan Police has said.
OL,10,FThe shooting happened shortly before
OL,11,F10pm on Monday on Willington Road,
OL,12,FClapham. The victim was pronounced
OL,13,Fdead at the scene.
OL,15,FThe Met said that shortly after the
OL,16,Fshooting, a 22-year-old man attended
OL,17,Fhospital with a gunshot wound. He has
OL,18,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,19,Fand remains in hospital.
