OL,3,CMan shot dead in south London
OL,5,FDetective Chief Superintendent Emma
OL,6,FBond said: "We understand that
OL,7,Fincident will cause concern within the
OL,8,Flocal community and an increased
OL,9,Fpolice presence will remain in the
OL,10,Farea throughout the day as our
OL,11,Finquiries continue. Our thoughts
OL,12,Fremain with the victim's family for
OL,13,Ftheir tragic loss.
OL,15,F"Officers have arrested a man on
OL,16,Fsuspicion of murder and we are working
OL,17,Ftirelessly to establish what happened.
