OL,3,CMan shot dead in south London
OL,5,F"We are asking anyone with information
OL,6,For anyone who may have witnessed the
OL,7,Fshooting to please contact us as soon
OL,8,Fas possible and support the ongoing
OL,9,Finvestigation."
